    "detailed_description": "This is a simple and complex puzzle game about light. <br>You need to use Optical components to direct lights and lit up the rings.<br><br><strong>Characteristics of light:</strong><br>\u25cf Light travels in a straight line<br>\u25cf Accordant with the Fresnel reflection<br>\u25cf Accordant with the principle of three primary colors<br>\u25cf Light travels at 299,792,458 m/s<br><br><strong>Function of Optical components:</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914090/extras/817fedf9532c8c721e1f37281c0fb7d6.webp?t=1744619668\" width=50 height=50 /></span><strong>Mirror</strong> - to reflect light<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914090/extras/2fe6a81ff81dfb07bb9bef5598c16fcf.webp?t=1744619668\" width=50 height=50 /></span><strong>Converter</strong> - to change the frequency of light and hence change its color<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914090/extras/02dc09e1f53efbc1c1964b704f0b4f97.webp?t=1744619668\" width=50 height=50 /></span><strong>Filter</strong> - Can only be passed through by the light of the same color<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914090/extras/2787c3b1e660fcb2997c580c7e1b25d7.webp?t=1744619668\" width=50 height=50 /></span><strong>Prism</strong> - to divide or gather light (not optical dispersion)<br><br><br>The ring will be lit up when light of the same color passes through.<br>You solve the puzzle by lighting up all rings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914090/extras/a9bda5fe4eadb70c8b187d03dbf666b0.avif?t=1744619668\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><br>After you solve the puzzle, the distribution of the performance of the community (number of prisms they use) will be shown to you. <br>You can choose to optimize your solution or move on.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914090/extras/da0d4deb490a5cc640a96d5fa6081652.avif?t=1744619668\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game control:</h2><strong>Left mouse button</strong> - to pick up or put down the component<br><strong>Mouse wheel</strong> - to rotate the component or turn pages<br><strong>Right mouse button</strong> - to delete the component<br><br><strong>R</strong> - Reset<br><strong>Z</strong> - Undo<br><br><strong>Number</strong> - to pick up the component<br><strong>Space</strong> - to switch the component<br><strong>Arrows</strong> - to rotate the component or turn pages",
    "about_the_game": "This is a simple and complex puzzle game about light. <br>You need to use Optical components to direct lights and lit up the rings.<br><br><strong>Characteristics of light:</strong><br>\u25cf Light travels in a straight line<br>\u25cf Accordant with the Fresnel reflection<br>\u25cf Accordant with the principle of three primary colors<br>\u25cf Light travels at 299,792,458 m/s<br><br><strong>Function of Optical components:</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914090/extras/817fedf9532c8c721e1f37281c0fb7d6.webp?t=1744619668\" width=50 height=50 /></span><strong>Mirror</strong> - to reflect light<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914090/extras/2fe6a81ff81dfb07bb9bef5598c16fcf.webp?t=1744619668\" width=50 height=50 /></span><strong>Converter</strong> - to change the frequency of light and hence change its color<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914090/extras/02dc09e1f53efbc1c1964b704f0b4f97.webp?t=1744619668\" width=50 height=50 /></span><strong>Filter</strong> - Can only be passed through by the light of the same color<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914090/extras/2787c3b1e660fcb2997c580c7e1b25d7.webp?t=1744619668\" width=50 height=50 /></span><strong>Prism</strong> - to divide or gather light (not optical dispersion)<br><br><br>The ring will be lit up when light of the same color passes through.<br>You solve the puzzle by lighting up all rings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914090/extras/a9bda5fe4eadb70c8b187d03dbf666b0.avif?t=1744619668\" width=616 height=346 />